1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:04,980
jis Eklavya ne guru Dronacharya ke
liye apna angootha katkar de diya tha,

2
00:00:05,270 --> 00:00:09,650
kya aap jante hain ki Harivansh ke anusar
woh Bhagwan Krishna ka chachera bhai bhi

3
00:00:09,650 --> 00:00:10,120
tha?

4
00:00:10,229 --> 00:00:14,789
Mahabharat ke Adiparv mein Eklavya ko
Nishad raj Hiranyadhanu ka putra bataya

5
00:00:14,789 --> 00:00:15,399
gaya hai.

6
00:00:15,477 --> 00:00:19,067
lekin Harivansh mein unki janm-katha
ka ek alag rahasya milta hai.

7
00:00:19,169 --> 00:00:22,699
iske anusar,
Eklavya ke vastvik pita Devashrava the,

8
00:00:22,829 --> 00:00:25,539
jo Bhagwan Krishna ke
pita Vasudev ke bhai the.

9
00:00:25,636 --> 00:00:29,946
yani Harivansh ke anusar Eklavya aur
Shri Krishna aapas mein chachere bhai the.

10
00:00:30,036 --> 00:00:34,696
lekin Eklavya ka palan-poshan Nishad
samuday mein hua aur isi karan unhe

11
00:00:34,696 --> 00:00:36,186
Nishadon se joda gaya.

12
00:00:36,248 --> 00:00:40,478
bade hokar Eklavya ne Dronacharya
se dhanurvidya seekhni chahi,

13
00:00:40,748 --> 00:00:43,438
lekin unhe shiksha dene
se mana kar diya gaya.

14
00:00:43,539 --> 00:00:48,179
iske baad Eklavya ne jungle mein
Dronacharya ki murti banai aur usi ko guru

15
00:00:48,179 --> 00:00:49,569
mankar abhyas kiya.

16
00:00:49,647 --> 00:00:52,427
jab Dronacharya ko unki
pratibha ka pata chala,

17
00:00:52,427 --> 00:00:56,657
toh unhone guru dakshina mein
unka dahina angootha mang liya.

18
00:00:56,747 --> 00:01:00,497
aur Eklavya ne bina kisi saval
ke apna angootha katkar de diya.

19
00:01:00,565 --> 00:01:01,375
sochiye,

20
00:01:01,405 --> 00:01:05,765
ek taraf guru dakshina dene wala Eklavya
aur doosri taraf Harivansh mein uska

21
00:01:05,765 --> 00:01:07,591
Krishna se parivarik rishta!

22
00:01:07,641 --> 00:01:09,471
kya aapne yeh baat pahle suni thi?

